.TH STOP-MU2EDAQ-DATAFORMAT-VIEWER.SH 1 "2026-10-06" "mu2edaq-dataformat-viewer t01.00.00" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
stop-mu2edaq-dataformat-viewer.sh \- stop the data format viewer started by its start script
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B stop\-mu2edaq\-dataformat\-viewer.sh
.RI [ PIDFILE ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Standardised Mu2e control-room stop script, run by
.BR "crs-app stop dataformat-viewer" .
Reads the PID file; if it is absent, or names a dead process, reports that,
removes a stale file and exits 0.
Otherwise sends SIGTERM, waits up to
.B CRS_STOP_TIMEOUT
seconds, sends SIGKILL if needed, and removes the PID file.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I PIDFILE
PID file, default
.I dataformat\-viewer.pid
next to the script.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B CRS_STOP_TIMEOUT
Seconds before SIGKILL; default 10.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0.
.SH EXAMPLES
.RS
.nf
\&./stop\-mu2edaq\-dataformat\-viewer.sh
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR start\-mu2edaq\-dataformat\-viewer.sh (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Mu2e DAQ group, Fermilab.
